From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:55:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): soften glass edges and brighten the touch core

Shared with Mihon 0073. Compare against the user-provided Xiaohongshu capsule references: remove both closed perimeter strokes and the shader's all-direction rim lift, use local soft reflections, and reduce thin-glass blur from 10dp to 7dp. Slightly reduce filled type to 13.5sp and its shadow radius to 1.5dp. Raise the contact peak from 0.42 to 0.62 and the inner shoulder to 0.34 while keeping the wide faint halo and existing gesture timing. No layout, hit-target, reselect or hidden-capture policy changes.
---
 .../core/components/material/BrowsingGlass.kt |  2 +-
 .../material/CapsuleNavigationLabel.kt        |  4 +-
 .../components/material/CapsuleRefraction.kt  |  2 +-
 .../components/material/NavigationCapsule.kt  | 66 +++++--------------
 4 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 54 deletions(-)

